; EXODUS.BIN: Ultima III (Origin 1983, PC version by James R. Van Artsdalen).
; Generated by tools/gen.py; tools/build.py builds it (MASM, LINK, then the image from 0100).
; SHRINE: stats header, shrines, leaving a dungeon (62FD-6B91).
;
; Code: PrintLevelHead (62FD: the dungeon headings "LVL:0n" and "Head-<facing>"),
; MonStepToPlayer (633B, for the creature movement in WORLD), EnterShrine (6366: a shrine of
; Ambrosia, gold for a stat) and ExitToSosaria (6458: out of a dungeon).
; Data (6493-6B91): four counters (CardsInserted, UpkeepTick, RegenTick, WhirlpoolTick),
; messages of PARTY, the Other command's words and handler table (OtherWords, OtherCmds), the
; name table NameTbl (136 names: 0-63 map shapes, 64-79 weapons, 80-87 armours, 88-103 wizard
; spells, 104-119 cleric spells, 120-135 monsters; docs/FORMATS.md 2) and its strings, the
; Ztats screen's labels, the status line labels and the strings of ACTIONS (Insert, Bribe,
; Pray, Word).
